    when: 'Pay moves when you can show one finished analysis and explain it to a lab head or a clinic owner.',
    reason: 'Data work can be sold directly to many labs, clinics and research teams in different cities, and later as a repeat service. The BSc alone is the crowded part.',
    layer: 'Small paid projects for labs and clinics, then repeat work for the same clients.',
    watch: 'Writing simple scripts is the part AI tools already do well. What stays valuable is knowing which biology question is worth asking and checking the answer.',
  },
  {
    rank: '02',
    tone: 'gold',
    scale: 'Scalable with a business layer',
    title: 'B.Pharm or Pharm.D, aimed at drug safety, clinical research and regulatory work',
    gate: 'In Andhra Pradesh the BiPC counselling lists B.Pharmacy and Pharm-D. The 2026 notice asks for Botany, Zoology, Physics and Chemistry at +2, with 45% for OC and 40% for BC, SC and ST. Pharm.D takes six years: five of study and one of internship or residency.',
    pay: 'Pharmacist: Rs 1.2 to 4.1 lakh overall, Rs 1.5 to 4.5 lakh at four years. Drug safety associate: Rs 2.3 to 6 lakh overall, Rs 2.9 to 7 lakh at four years (AmbitionBox samples).',
