    when: 'The first job comes early. The jump comes from a specialty, a move abroad, or nursing education.',
    reason: 'Pay in India has a low ceiling, but a licensed skill that travels, plus home nursing or training services, gives a business layer.',
    layer: 'A trained home-nursing service for families, or teaching and training roles after clinical experience.',
    watch: 'The abroad route needs registration with that country\'s regulator, a language test and a contract from a real employer. Confirm the steps on the official site, and never pay an agent who promises a job.',
  },
  {
    rank: '05',
    tone: 'gold',
    scale: 'Scalable with a business layer',
    title: 'BPT (physiotherapy)',
