  { q: 'Which course has the highest salary for BiPC students?', a: 'None pays a high salary quickly. In the pay samples used here, the jobs these courses lead to top out near Rs 4.5 to 7.5 lakh a year after four years. The larger pay comes later, from a postgraduate seat or your own practice, from a skill stack in pharmacy or data, or from nursing abroad.' },
  { q: 'Which high salary course can BiPC students do without NEET?', a: 'B.Pharm and Pharm.D through the state BiPC counselling in Andhra Pradesh, B.Tech Biotechnology or Pharmaceutical Engineering, and a life-science BSc with a data skill. Pay depends on the skill you add after the degree, not on the course name.' },
