  { q: 'Is MBBS the only high salary option after BiPC?', a: 'No. MBBS has about 16 NEET registrations for every seat, and specialist pay comes only after internship and then a second seat. Other lanes usually cost less and start earning sooner, such as pharmacy with a regulatory skill or data work in health, though none promises a higher final income.' },
