  <h2 id="money-check">Money check before you pay</h2>

  <p>
    An approved degree is not optional for nursing, pharmacy, physiotherapy, dentistry or medicine, because the licence depends on it. Even so, the college is only one part of how your career turns out.
  </p>

  <p>
    Our strongest suggestion: keep the whole course fee near a tenth of your family's total education budget, and treat anything above roughly a fifth as a caution that needs course-specific evidence. This does not apply to free YouTube lessons or low-priced courses on sites like Udemy or Coursera, and the same course sold as a university certificate can cost 30 to 100 times more, so look at free and cheap options first.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table">
